+| G4 structure-aware guess | Pass | 0/200,000 hits at `medium`; sampler is uniform over sorted size-40 subsets |
+| G5 sparse | Pass | Demo seed 303: 1/1,352,078 valid, fraction 7.39602301050679e-7 |
